{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">G.M.M (Guerrier Mages and Metamorphes) is a turn-based 2D RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Marco, a young boy who wants to become a swordsman and his mage friend Vard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During one of their mission, they will encounter a metamorph of the wolf clan with serious wound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But by helping him, they will put themself into a major conflict between several country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the world to gain new allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your allies to learn new techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight enemies in turn-based battles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600380?t=1742922176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600380?t=1742922176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600380/e6559ad64db87708d2091ff8a5cb7eea48950a6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742922176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600380/e6559ad64db87708d2091ff8a5cb7eea48950a6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742922176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">G.M.M (Guerrier Mages and Metamorphes) is a turn-based 2D RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Marco, a young boy who wants to become a swordsman and his mage friend Vard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During one of their mission, they will encounter